  unitName: Dragon God Granados
  unitId: 10095
  unitNumber: 750
  description: Lava from deep beneath the ground which gained a will of its own,
    manifesting itself in the form of a dragon. Its red-hot claws are hot enough
    to mold metal with a simple touch, and its blazing wings have the power to dry
    up entire oceans. The existence of this creature alone altered the topography
    of the world, alluding to the idea that it was not initially part of the gods'
    plans. When its amazing powers overflow to the surface, they solidify in an instant.
    It is said that in order to send this dangerous creature back to its home the
    gods had to make many a sacrifice.
  summonDesc: There's no use in self-doubt.<br>Just let your soul burn.<br>Life is
    but a dancing flame!
  fusionDesc: Yes, throw these souls into the fire.<br>Make it hotter, and hotter!<br>Feed
    these souls to the flame!
  evoDesc: Burn your heart.<br>Incinerate your soul.<br>It will glorify your existence!
  element: 1
  rarity: 5
